abstract: >-
  Code, raw data and generated results for a controlled audit of the UCI
  ann-thyroid multiclass benchmark. Rebuilds the cohort table from the raw
  files, establishes the class semantics at record level against the sibling
  files distributed in the same UCI directory, and evaluates whether reported
  performance differences between feature-selection methods and class-balancing
  strategies are large enough to matter.
